{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在電視節目《今個夏天食平Ｄ》中，肥媽為大家示範了一道香濃惹味的家常菜——「豆卜枝竹炆斑頭腩」。斑頭腩肉質非常肥美，而這道菜的靈魂在於讓枝竹和豆卜完全吸收濃郁的醬汁，極之入味！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"71e27de0-484d-4f8e-be54-89ac3191c698.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026PaO4RnrnmP1786418968.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"71e27de0-484d-4f8e-be54-89ac3191c698.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">準備食材</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">主料： 斑頭腩、豆卜、枝竹</p></li><li></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">配料： 薑、蔥頭、蔥段、蔥、辣椒</p></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">製作步驟</p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e83bdef2-e622-4c0c-a3d8-4f8f708a212e.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026mVFxmvejhD1786418974.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e83bdef2-e622-4c0c-a3d8-4f8f708a212e.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e73c319b-a1df-4d02-b026-600e08f61ac1.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026Z7UBz91G8L1786418978.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e73c319b-a1df-4d02-b026-600e08f61ac1.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">實用小貼士</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li></ul></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-18T01:39:03.199258+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}